{
"width":15,
"active":112,
"test":{"name":"ui-supply-cut-line","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"supplyCutLine","question":"The cut supply line (SupplyNetwork.CutRoute, SupplyOverlay.ForSelection and AllLines; drawn with Resources/SupplyLineCut.prefab, the marker Resources/SupplyContact.prefab). Blue's HQ at (-6,0), a Blue supply unit at (-3,0), an APC carrying supplies at (2,0). Nobody about: linked, so selecting the APC shows no cut line and no marker. A line of Red grunts across x=-1: cut off; selected, the APC shows a cut line from its tile, tile by tile, to the source that should feed it (the supply unit, its tile last), cut at the first tile beside a grunt, the marker there (on no unit). With nobody about and the APC down to 1 move: cut by distance, at the first tile it cannot reach this turn. All supply lines (the option, off by default): the cut line and its marker, and each linked supply unit's line to what feeds it (the HQ). Under fog with the wall unseen: the same cut line, the marker on no unseen grunt and no Blue unit, beside a grunt. And with the APC's supply reaching the grunts' tiles: it is cut off, so no grunt's tile shows its supply (a grunt's tile is filled only from supply truly beside it; it used to be filled from the board as Blue knows it, where the APC links, so its supply showed in the fog round it and not in sight).","rules":"standard"},
